{"id":"628503","name":"豆沙小点心","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/628503/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"150g"},{"name":"低筋面粉","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"菜籽油","amount":"40g"},{"name":"奶粉","amount":"15g"},{"name":"水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"35g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉五得力5星级150g，低筋面粉50g。","img":"images/628503/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入白糖、奶粉、泡打粉、酵母粉、食用油。","img":"images/628503/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/628503/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"和成面团饧20分钟。","img":"images/628503/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"之前做好的大白豆豆沙馅。","img":"images/628503/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"分成3份，其中一份加适量绿茶拌匀。","img":"images/628503/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"和成绿色豆沙馅。","img":"images/628503/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"另一份放入南瓜粉拌匀。","img":"images/628503/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"这份是用茯苓粉和成的。","img":"images/628503/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"个不同颜色的豆沙馅分别和成团。","img":"images/628503/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搓成等量的小圆球。","img":"images/628503/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"将面皮料分成等量的小剂子。","img":"images/628503/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"将其中一个剂子擀成面皮。","img":"images/628503/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"将豆沙馅逐个包好，收口在下。","img":"images/628503/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"将面坯放入烤盘中。","img":"images/628503/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"盖个印章好看些。","img":"images/628503/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"烤箱先预热10分钟，再将烤盘放入中下层，上下150度烤18至20分钟。","img":"images/628503/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"豆沙小点心出炉晾凉。","img":"images/628503/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"装盘上桌吧，三种颜色豆沙馅皮软香甜，可做茶歇点心食用。","img":"images/628503/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"掰开看看三种颜色的内馅，皮软馅大、非常好吃。","img":"images/628503/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}